{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Q20dMlGA0CchvO83fBoexg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:42.185594+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Q20dMlGA0CchvO83fBoexg","html":"<div><p><span><span>想</span></span><span><span>增进对清华大学深圳国际研究生院生物医药与健康工程研究院（</span></span><span><span><span>iBHE</span></span></span><span><span>）的了解吗？</span></span></p><p><span><span>想与iBHE教师代表面对面交流吗？</span></span></p><p><span><span>想一起探索生物医药前沿吗？</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>快来参加</span></span><span><span><span>iBHE</span></span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营”吧！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/UibGydvia13zicfcFQzNdpHLjoBiblanF5mtRfluicsMvmjPxFVZro4ibz8dQkvsT9YOZ0dRxIx0LPGicnTV9ftjx7P4w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>活动形式：<span>线下</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>活动时间：</span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>-2</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>活动内容：主要包括</span><span><span>iBHE</span></span><span>介绍、实验室参观、师生互动交流等</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span><span></span></p><ol><li><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好、遵纪守法、身心健康。</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>全国高校本科在校生（</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>年应届毕业），本科专业要求：生物医学工程、材料工程、化学、化学工程、生物工程、生物学、药学、医学、制药工程、电子信息、电气工程、计算机、精密仪器等相关专业。</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>本科前</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>学期总评成绩在该校同年级本专业排名中名列前茅。</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力。</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为。</span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>二、报名材料</span></span><span></span></p><ol><li><p><span>报名问卷在线填写；</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>有效身份证明（二代居民身份证）；</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>在学证明（学生证）；</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>外语水平证明（不限于雅思、托福、英语四六级等成绩单证明材料）；</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>成绩单及排名证明：前</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>学期的各科成绩单与前</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>学期的年级总评成绩排名（需盖学校或院系教务部门公章）；</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>个人简历（不超过</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>页）；</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>其它材料：包括获奖证书复印件</span><span><span>(</span></span><span>学术类相关奖项</span><span><span>)</span></span><span>，能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物等。</span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>三、报名时间及方式</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>报名时间：</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>8:00 - 6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>20</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>17:00</span></span></p><p><span>报名链接：</span><span><span>https://www.wjx.top/vm/t9RakCE.aspx</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UibGydvia13zicfcFQzNdpHLjoBiblanF5mtP99CRia8PNgMMqtHxKALvO3CibVy0zrsFvzhaYuDUvwBgSxaeiaAyUV3Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span><span>入营通知</span><span>：拟于</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>26</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>17:00</span></span><span>前以邮件方式发送到申请人报名时预留电子信箱</span><span>，请保持邮件及手机畅通；未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>四、费用说明</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>本次夏令营不收取任何费用，入选营员交通和食宿自理，夏令营结束后生物医药与健康工程研究院将提供活动补贴</span><span><span>300</span></span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人（包含交通与住宿补贴）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>五、研究院、师资、项目介绍</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UibGydvia13zicfcFQzNdpHLjoBiblanF5mt4GI0cLnt6ly1PmUkwiakuB7eEgAOcdD5iaz0zb77ciaE1drSwfwFRTBqg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>生物医药与健康工程研究院师资与项目详情，请访问生物医药与健康工程研究院官网</span><span><span>https://www.sigs.tsinghua.edu.cn/936/list.htm</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>六、注意事项</span></span><span></span></p><ol><li><p><span>学生需保证全部报名材料的真实性，对在夏令营过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，将撤销相应资格。</span><span></span></p></li><li><p><span>如因不可抗力影响或上级部门出台新政策、安排或计划调整，导致夏令营工作安排或信息变化的，生物医药与健康工程研究院将做相应调整，最终以生物医药与健康工程研究院发布的相关通知为准。</span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>七、咨询方式</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>曾老师：</span><span><span>0755-26404909</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询邮箱：</span></span><span><span>ibhe_admission@sz.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e7957f5abdab5b9d86e456e51db0545ea0f84ce0612fd917a301b701b411f783","textLength":1087,"sourceSha256":"19ea5fe8e86c14de8fd93045656cceef914ca995e21c0e1569ef83290b9fe616","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2c396154a56132e5941e","title":"2025年清华大学深圳国际研究生院生物医药与健康工程研究院2025夏令营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:42.185594+00:00"}
